### 회원가입 - 성공 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "최승환",
  "username": "test@naver.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname": "안양개발자"
}

### 회원가입 - 실패: username 중복 (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "김지선",
  "username": "test@naver.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname": "전주 족발집 알바생"
}

### 회원가입 - 실패: nickname 중복 (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "김태영",
  "username": "test123@naver.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname": "안양개발자"
}

### 회원가입 - 실패: 이메일 형식 오류 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "정선우",
  "username": "oh-yeah",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname": "살려조"
}

### 회원가입 - 실패: 비밀번호 8자미만 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "김태영",
  "username": "test3@naver.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "광명원펀치"
}

### 회원가입 - 실패: 필수값 누락 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "username": "test4@naver.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname": "새닉네임3"
}

### 로그인 - 성공 (200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test@naver.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refreshToken);
%}

### 로그인 - 실패: 존재하지 않는 계정 (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "non-exist@naver.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### 로그인 - 실패: 비밀번호 불일치 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test@naver.com",
  "password": "test5555"
}

### 내 정보 조회 - 성공
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}



### 로그아웃 - 성공 (200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 재발급 성공 (200) / 재발급 - 실패: 쿠키 없음 (400)-(로그아웃하고 실행)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/reissue

